{"id":"captura","lemma":"captura","pos":"noun","rank":3601,"glosses":["capture","catch (that which is captured or caught)","screenshot"],"ipa":"/kabˈtuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"capturas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-captura.wav","examples":[{"text":"La captura del príncipe por el rey llevó a otra guerra.","en":"The capture of the prince by the king led to another war.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693328","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"prince"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"king"},{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},{"g":"war, warfare"}]},{"text":"Tom hizo una captura impresionante.","en":"Tom made a great catch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302023","words":[null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"impressive"}]},{"text":"Los pescadores tomaron fotos de su captura.","en":"The fishermen took photos of their catch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693812","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"fishing","l":"pescador"},{"g":"to take","l":"tomar"},{"g":"photo, photograph","l":"foto"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Las grandes capturas de calamar son un signo de un terremoto que viene.","en":"Large catches of squid are a sign of a coming earthquake.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"big, large","l":"grande"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"squid"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"sign, indication"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"earthquake"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"}]}]}